f('N-04','File upload.','Upload controls (leave, complaints, warnings, appreciation letters, finance adjustments and expenses, employee documents) send the file name and size to the mock; no file content is read or stored. Exports (reports, expenses, payroll, finance reports) return a file name and size, not a file.','Partial','Source review.','Real upload, scan, encryption and generation are untested.','Integrate multipart upload and binary download.')
