L+=['','Category key: A requirements coverage · B API mapping · C screens · D workflows · E validation/errors · F roles · G RTL/LTR and language · H themes · I brand · J responsive · K animation · L accessibility · M demo data · N missing or non-functional interactions · O visual consistency.','','## 6. What is what','','| Layer | Content |','|---|---|','| Fully implemented UI | Authentication gates, profile/security, employees, accounts, roles/permissions, departments, delegations, shifts, holidays, attendance, devices, import, leave, requests/memos/fault reports, complaints and handler assignments, reports and reviewer dashboard, notifications, reminder settings, settings hub, audit log, evaluation and monthly department report, circulars, store and custody, contracts, warnings, appreciation letters, salary profiles, adjustments and attendance suggestions, expenses, payroll runs, payslips, finance reports and finance settings, design-system showcase. |','| Interactive mock behavior | All server rules above: approval matrix, leave arithmetic and balance ledger, complaint routing and access policy, delegation effects, attendance generation, evaluation cycles, stock and custody movements, contract and warning lifecycles, payroll calculation and locking, validation and error codes. State persists across users until reset. |','| Real API integration | None. |','| Untested functionality | Visual rendering, themes against references, responsive layouts, animation playback, keyboard and screen-reader behaviour, real uploads/downloads and exports. |','| Missing backend dependencies | OIDC identity server and token endpoint, ABP application configuration, database and migrations, encrypted file storage with antivirus, notification delivery (in-app, email, push), fingerprint-device ingestion and import parsing, scheduled jobs (leave year rollover, reminders, late-complaint reminders, contract alert window, warning response window, cycle opening), audit log, report, payroll and finance export generation, payslip PDF generation, stock costing and expense creation, hosting country/currency/biometric model decisions. |','','## 7. Coverage by module','']+modtbl+['','## 8. User flows','','| Flow | Name | Status | Operations not wired |','|---|---|---|---|']+['| '+' | '.join(esc(x) for x in r)+' |' for r in fr]+['','See UNRESOLVED_ISSUES.md for the prioritized list and DEVELOPER_HANDOFF.md for integration guidance.','']
